    "Write" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schreiben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app may not read your contacts. You can allow it in Settings, or ask your agent to give the number." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese App darf deine Kontakte nicht lesen. Du kannst es in den Einstellungen erlauben oder deinen Agenten nach der Nummer fragen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No contact with a number or an address for this name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kein Kontakt mit Nummer oder Adresse zu diesem Namen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the message" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nachricht öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where what you write goes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Where what you write goes"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wohin geht, was du schreibst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you write here goes to your Bot Server at %@. Your Bot Server answers with models of these companies, which then read what you write and what your agents send them:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you write here goes to your Bot Server at %@. Your Bot Server answers with models of these companies, which then read what you write and what your agents send them:"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was du hier schreibst, geht an deinen Bot Server unter %@. Dein Bot Server antwortet mit Modellen dieser Firmen, die dann lesen, was du schreibst und was deine Agenten ihnen schicken:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That can be your messages, the files and photos you add, the answers this phone sends back for your agents, and what your agents found. Each company handles it under its own terms." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That can be your messages, the files and photos you add, the answers this phone sends back for your agents, and what your agents found. Each company handles it under its own terms."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das können deine Nachrichten sein, die Dateien und Fotos, die du anhängst, die Antworten, die dieses Telefon für deine Agenten zurückschickt, und was deine Agenten gefunden haben. Jede Firma geht damit nach ihren eigenen Bedingungen um."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A model on your own computer, such as Ollama, and the model on this phone read it where they are and need no yes. You can take your yes back in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A model on your own computer, such as Ollama, and the model on this phone read it where they are and need no yes. You can take your yes back in Settings."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
